{"articleNo":"514125","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=514125&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2025학년도 여름 계절수업 폐강과목 알림 및 정원 외 수강신청 안내","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2025.05.15","hit":"5385","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2025</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;\">학년도 여름 계절수업 폐강과목 알림 및 정원 외 수강신청 안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>유의사항 :</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>-&nbsp; 2025학년도 여름계절수업은&nbsp; 정해진 수강료납부기간(6.2&nbsp;~6.4, 3일간)외에는&nbsp;</b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">수강료 추가납부기간이 운영되지 않으니,</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; 반드시 기간 내 수업료를 납부완료하기 바랍니다.</b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(미납시 수강취소됨)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; background-color: rgb(171, 242, 0);\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">- 2 과목 수강신청시 1 과목만&nbsp; 수강취소 불가</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(2과목 수강신청자가 1과목수업료만 납부할 경우 2과목 모두 수강취소됨)</span><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 1rem;\"></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">아래의 폐강과목 수강신청 내역은 5</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">월&nbsp;15</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">일 일괄 삭제처리 되었으니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;대상과목을 수강 신청한 학생이&nbsp;다른 과목으로 수강을 원할 경우 정원외 수강신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><table width=\"875px\" style=\"width: 875px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; width: 83.61pt; height: 25.36pt; border-width: 1.41pt 0.56pt 0.56pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(212, 244, 250);\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">개설학과</span></b></span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; width: 83.61pt; height: 25.36pt; border-width: 1.41p